    "No power-on/load-step/protection/reset waveform, clock uncertainty or measured thermal model was found in these photos.",
    "The PDF contains an Encrypt dictionary. Direct rawJPEG extraction was rejected when stream bytes lacked JPEG markers; no image from that attempt was retained. Standard Poppler rendering works with the public document."
